WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Gravewright 0.2.1 Alpha — Your table. Your adventure.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Explore Moonfall Abbey and move character tokens on the tabletop.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Open the DnD 5e SRD sheet. Edit an ability score; the sheet saves automatically.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Search the licensed SRD compendium for a dagger.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Drag the dagger onto the sheet. It appears in the inventory and is saved.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Review prepared spells, spell slots and character resources.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Use the combat tracker to follow initiative and advance to the next turn.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Send a message and roll dice. The results appear directly in chat.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
